      "4": {
        "citation": "Pinned OSHB/WLC Song 4:16 includes both the north/south-wind material printed as Douay 4:16 and the invitation for the beloved to enter the garden printed at the opening of Douay 5:1. Equal numeric verse inventories therefore do not imply a clean one-to-one boundary at 4:16."
      },
      "6": {
        "citation": "Pinned OSHB/WLC Song 6:1 is the 'Whither is thy beloved gone?' material printed as Douay 5:17, while OSHB/WLC 7:1 begins with the 'Return, return, O Shulamite' material printed as Douay 6:12. Equal numeric verse counts in chapter 6 therefore mask a cross-chapter shift."
      }
    }
  },
